# Statcast snapshots are LOCAL-ONLY (2026-09-08 decision): ~2GB tracked bloated
# .git to 2.1GB and the 2026 file is rewritten by every refresh, poisoning every
# future commit/push. Files stay on disk; fresh clones rebuild via
# production/ops/refresh_statcast.py (incremental Savant fetch). History keeps
# old blobs until a filter-repo pass (optional follow-up, needs sign-off).
data/Savant-Data/
Data/Savant-Data/
# Historical odds pulls (SmartStake HF cache, Kalshi cache, Odds API raw JSON +
# normalized parquet). Vendor data is re-downloadable; never commit it.
data/Odds-Historical/
Data/Odds-Historical/
